{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36332","headline":"送钱特卿赴职天台 · 方干","name":"送钱特卿赴职天台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"路入仙溪气象清，垂鞭树石罅中行。\n雾昏不见西陵岸，风急先闻瀑布声。\n山下县寮张乐送，海边津吏棹舟迎。\n诗家弟子无多少，唯只於余别有情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}